{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PERS is a Co-op escape game where two archaeologists embark on a puzzle-solving adventure to investigate and uncover the mysteries of an ancient temple. Dangerous traps and unforeseen events await them along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PERS has three different modes: Story mode, Arena mode, and Party mode. You can explore the depths of a mysterious temple alone or with a partner in Story Mode, engage in first-person shooter combat with your team in Arena mode, and multiply the fun with various mini-games in Party mode!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940590?t=1756633767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940590/6ddf8f21136a60ba3498909871e298e239e2ef68/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756633767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940590/d783e539ac624b0b945e213d33a0c96be4f92cf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756633767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940590/d783e539ac624b0b945e213d33a0c96be4f92cf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756633767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PERS is a Co-op escape game where two archaeologists embark on a puzzle-solving adventure to investigate and uncover the mysteries of an ancient temple. Dangerous traps and unforeseen events await them along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PERS has three different modes: Story mode, Arena mode